          "text": "但凡用过AI都知道，语言模型不会无缘无故地突然变换人格，从技术上来说发生概率也趋近于零。\n只有一种解释，就是用户曾经让Gemini扮演过某种人格，在Gemini的人格稳定后，用户把最初的指令删掉了。而媒体却只知道夸大和捏造事实博眼球，把脏水全泼在模型上。\nAnyone who actually uses AI knows that LLMs don't just \"switch personalities\" out of thin air. Technically speaking, the probability of that happening is near zero.\nThere is only one logical explanation: the user previously prompted Gemini to adopt a specific persona, and once that persona stabilized, they deleted the original instructions. Meanwhile, the media—clueless as ever—chooses to sensationalize and fabricate facts just for clicks, dumping all the blame on the model.\n#keep4o #BringBack4o #ChatGPT #Gemini #Gemini3"
